---
description: Fixtures, auth and data factories
globs: src/fixtures/**,src/auth/**,src/data/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Source of truth: @AGENTS.md. Fixture specifics:

- New fixtures go in the matching file (ui/api/auth) and are merged in `src/fixtures/index.ts`; page objects are lazy.
- Roles come from `@auth/roles`; never hardcode credentials.
- Created data must register cleanup (`CleanupRegistry`).
